### ════════════════════════════════════════════════
### EasyVote API - Tests
### Backend tourne sur http://localhost:8082
### ════════════════════════════════════════════════

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8082/api
@email = ahmed@test.com
@password = password123

### 1. Register - Création de compte
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "fullName": "Ahmed Ltayef",
  "studentId": "STU001"
}

### 2. Verify OTP - Remplace 123456 par le code reçu dans Mailtrap
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "code": "422384"
}

### 3. Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 4. Resend OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/resend-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}"
}

### 5. Get current user (collez le accessToken de la réponse login/verify-otp)
@accessToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJhaG1lZEB0ZXN0LmNvbSIsInVzZXJJZCI6MSwicm9sZSI6IlNUVURFTlQiLCJmdWxsTmFtZSI6IkFobWVkIEx0YXllZiIsImlhdCI6MTc3NzYxMTg1OCwiZXhwIjoxNzc3Njk4MjU4fQ.SIrEG8RCiVlspa_0EYHrT8BY3aUKwjbq03Ba6qn2rCAhlrvy_0ObbmW7YbJ55tWPlTr5CkBzE85PwInR_hAJPg

GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 6. Refresh Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "COLLE_LE_REFRESH_TOKEN_ICI"
}